{"id":"1a076c75424467df","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass.md","title":"ZFC PCF Simplified Morass","display":"df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass — ZFC PCF Simplified Morass","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass — ZFC PCF Simplified Morass","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-prop-cardinal-successor]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-fun-identity-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass — ZFC PCF Simplified Morass"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6baae1c4b76f905\" href=\"?note=d6baae1c4b76f905\" title=\"58-prop-cardinal-successor\">58-prop-cardinal-successor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0fa54d1179f79de7\" href=\"?note=0fa54d1179f79de7\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-fun-identity-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-fun-identity-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mu,\\Theta,F,D_\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mu,\\Theta,F,D_\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are the regular- and successor-cardinal predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are the cardinal, ordinal, and limit-ordinal predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> are the set-function and equinumerosity predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_\\mu=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\mu+1)^2:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_\\mu=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\mu+1)^2:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}simplified\\text{-}morass}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mu\n\\land\\exists\\kappa,B_\\Theta,B_F,\\Theta,F\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\mu+1,B_\\Theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,D_\\mu,B_F)\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Theta(0)=1\\land\\Theta(\\mu)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;(0&lt;\\Theta(\\alpha)&lt;\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu+1\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\Theta(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D_\\mu\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Theta(\\alpha),\\Theta(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall\\xi,\\eta\\in\\Theta(\\alpha)\\;\n(\\xi&lt;\\eta\\to f(\\xi)&lt;f(\\eta))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\Bigl(\\beta&lt;\\mu\\to\n\\exists\\nu\\in\\mu\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),\\nu)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\leq\\mu\\;\\Bigl(\nF(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)\n=\\{f\\circ g:g\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\land f\\in F(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;\\exists h\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle)\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\Theta(\\alpha)\\;\\Bigl(\nF(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle)\n=\\{\\operatorname{id}_{\\Theta(\\alpha)},h\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\delta\\;(h(\\xi)=\\xi)\n\\land h(\\delta)\\geq\\Theta(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mu+1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\gamma)\\to\n\\forall\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\gamma\\;\n\\forall f_0\\in F(\\langle\\beta_0,\\gamma\\rangle)\\;\n\\forall f_1\\in F(\\langle\\beta_1,\\gamma\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\exists\\delta\\in\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\beta_0&lt;\\delta\\land\\beta_1&lt;\\delta\n\\land\\exists g_0\\in F(\\langle\\beta_0,\\delta\\rangle)\\;\n\\exists g_1\\in F(\\langle\\beta_1,\\delta\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\exists h\\in F(\\langle\\delta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\;\n(f_0=h\\circ g_0\\land f_1=h\\circ g_1)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu+1\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;\\alpha\\to\n\\Theta(\\alpha)=\\bigcup\\{f``\\Theta(\\beta):\n\\beta\\in\\alpha\\land f\\in F(\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle)\\}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}simplified\\text{-}morass}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mu\n\\land\\exists\\kappa,B_\\Theta,B_F,\\Theta,F\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\mu+1,B_\\Theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,D_\\mu,B_F)\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Theta(0)=1\\land\\Theta(\\mu)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;(0&lt;\\Theta(\\alpha)&lt;\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu+1\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\Theta(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D_\\mu\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Theta(\\alpha),\\Theta(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall\\xi,\\eta\\in\\Theta(\\alpha)\\;\n(\\xi&lt;\\eta\\to f(\\xi)&lt;f(\\eta))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\Bigl(\\beta&lt;\\mu\\to\n\\exists\\nu\\in\\mu\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),\\nu)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta&lt;\\gamma\\leq\\mu\\;\\Bigl(\nF(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)\n=\\{f\\circ g:g\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\land f\\in F(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;\\exists h\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle)\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\Theta(\\alpha)\\;\\Bigl(\nF(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle)\n=\\{\\operatorname{id}_{\\Theta(\\alpha)},h\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\delta\\;(h(\\xi)=\\xi)\n\\land h(\\delta)\\geq\\Theta(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mu+1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\gamma)\\to\n\\forall\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\gamma\\;\n\\forall f_0\\in F(\\langle\\beta_0,\\gamma\\rangle)\\;\n\\forall f_1\\in F(\\langle\\beta_1,\\gamma\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{19mm}\\exists\\delta\\in\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\beta_0&lt;\\delta\\land\\beta_1&lt;\\delta\n\\land\\exists g_0\\in F(\\langle\\beta_0,\\delta\\rangle)\\;\n\\exists g_1\\in F(\\langle\\beta_1,\\delta\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\exists h\\in F(\\langle\\delta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\;\n(f_0=h\\circ g_0\\land f_1=h\\circ g_1)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu+1\\;\\Bigl(0&lt;\\alpha\\to\n\\Theta(\\alpha)=\\bigcup\\{f``\\Theta(\\beta):\n\\beta\\in\\alpha\\land f\\in F(\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle)\\}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both level and transition-family sequences are now explicit set functions.  The successor cardinal, family-size bound, composition law, splitting step, limit coherence, and coverage clause are therefore statements about declared set-coded objects rather than implicit indexed classes.</li>\n<li>Ordinary composition here is composition of arbitrary ordinal maps.  The unrelated recursion-theoretic operator restricted to maps on powers of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> is therefore not used as its source.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-prop-cardinal-successor","status":"resolved","id":"d6baae1c4b76f905","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-prop-cardinal-successor]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-fun-identity-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fa54d1179f79de7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-fun-identity-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,\\mu,\\Theta,F,D_\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\mu=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\mu+1)^2:\\alpha<\\beta\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf\\text{-}simplified\\text{-}morass}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\omega<\\mu\n\\land\\exists\\kappa,B_\\Theta,B_F,\\Theta,F\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\kappa,\\mu)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Theta,\\mu+1,B_\\Theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,D_\\mu,B_F)\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\Theta(0)=1\\land\\Theta(\\mu)=\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;(0<\\Theta(\\alpha)<\\mu)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu+1\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\Theta(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D_\\mu\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\Theta(\\alpha),\\Theta(\\beta))\\\\\n&\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall\\xi,\\eta\\in\\Theta(\\alpha)\\;\n(\\xi<\\eta\\to f(\\xi)<f(\\eta))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\land\\Bigl(\\beta<\\mu\\to\n\\exists\\nu\\in\\mu\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\\land\n\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),\\nu)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\beta<\\gamma\\leq\\mu\\;\\Bigl(\nF(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)\n=\\{f\\circ g:g\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\land f\\in F(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu\\;\\exists h\\in F(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle)\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\Theta(\\alpha)\\;\\Bigl(\nF(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha+1\\rangle)\n=\\{\\operatorname{id}_{\\Theta(\\alpha)},h\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\delta\\;(h(\\xi)=\\xi)\n\\land h(\\delta)\\geq\\Theta(\\alpha)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mu+1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Limit}(\\gamma)\\to\n\\forall\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\gamma\\;\n\\forall f_0\\in F(\\langle\\beta_0,\\gamma\\rangle)\\;\n\\forall f_1\\in F(\\langle\\beta_1,\\gamma\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{19mm}\\exists\\delta\\in\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\beta_0<\\delta\\land\\beta_1<\\delta\n\\land\\exists g_0\\in F(\\langle\\beta_0,\\delta\\rangle)\\;\n\\exists g_1\\in F(\\langle\\beta_1,\\delta\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{49mm}\\exists h\\in F(\\langle\\delta,\\gamma\\rangle)\\;\n(f_0=h\\circ g_0\\land f_1=h\\circ g_1)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mu+1\\;\\Bigl(0<\\alpha\\to\n\\Theta(\\alpha)=\\bigcup\\{f``\\Theta(\\beta):\n\\beta\\in\\alpha\\land f\\in F(\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle)\\}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":3863,"backlinks":[{"id":"952d622641f51ebe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcfSimplifiedMorass}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3035","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass.md|58-df-zfc-pcf-simplified-morass]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","0fbfc19800246e77","d6baae1c4b76f905","28c79fde9f892bfe","0fa54d1179f79de7","30f7fa6c101bbb39"]}